# X Y R G B A TOL LABEL   (RGBA in the UI target, premultiplied)
# blur(4px) of a 1 px line: the centre is about 25/255, and 4 px away it is about 60% of that, symmetrically
160 160 25 25 25 25 6 blur centre
164 160 15 15 15 15 6 blur right 4px
156 160 15 15 15 15 6 blur left 4px
180 160 0 0 0 0 2 blur far
# drop-shadow(12px 12px 0): the icon is blue inside the circle; the shadow is red and follows the circle, not the box
331 131 0 0 255 255 4 icon centre
362 143 255 0 0 255 4 shadow only
302 102 0 0 0 0 1 box corner stays empty
370 170 0 0 0 0 1 offset box corner stays empty
# group opacity 0.5: overlap and non-overlap are the same
530 150 128 0 0 128 4 group one child
590 150 128 0 0 128 4 group overlap
660 150 128 0 0 128 4 group other child
# glow: the shadow of a white square, no offset, is green around it
830 130 255 255 255 255 2 glow box
797 130 0 60 0 60 40 glow near
# nested layer: the inner group is blue at 50%
170 450 0 0 128 128 6 nested inner
# blur(16px) of a yellow square: the middle is still yellow, the edge is half
560 460 255 255 0 255 40 big middle
